        "Plans & Pricing: Monthly 2.99€/month • Yearly 29€/year (Popular — save over 19%) • Lifetime 49€ (one-time payment, forever)." to "Tarifs : Mensuel 2,99 €/mois • Annuel 29 €/an (Populaire — économisez plus de 19 %) • À vie 49 € (paiement unique).",
