        // LegalDocumentsDialog.kt
        "1. Scope & Data Controller (Updated: November 2026)" to "1. Champ d'application et responsable (Mise à jour : novembre 2026)",
        "This Privacy Policy explains how Finsay (finsayapp.com, package com.kynigos.oikonomos) collects, uses, processes, stores, and protects your personal and financial tracking data. It is designed to comply with the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR 2016/679), Greek Law 4624/2019, the UK GDPR, applicable United States privacy statutes (including the California CCPA/CPRA, Virginia VCDPA, Colorado CPA, Connecticut CTDPA, and Texas TDPSA), and Google Play Developer Program Policies. Data Controller contact: support@finsayapp.com." to "Cette Politique de confidentialité explique comment Finsay (finsayapp.com, package com.kynigos.oikonomos) collecte, utilise, stocke et protège vos données personnelles et budgétaires, conformément au RGPD (UE 2016/679), à la loi grecque 4624/2019, au UK GDPR, aux lois américaines applicables (CCPA/CPRA, VCDPA, CPA, CTDPA, TDPSA) et aux règles Google Play. Contact : support@finsayapp.com.",
        "2. Categories of Data Collected & Profile Isolation" to "2. Données collectées et isolation du profil",
        "• Account & Authentication Data: Name, email address, unique user identifier (UID), and profile photo obtained via Google Sign-In (Android Credential Manager) or Email/Password through Firebase Authentication.\n• Private Profile Details (Strictly Owner-Only): Optional fields such as phone number, date of birth, occupation, and city are isolated in a private sub-document readable and writable exclusively by your authenticated account—never exposed to other users during ledger-sharing lookups.\n• Financial & Budget Records: Amounts, titles/descriptions, categories, dates, payment sources, selected ledger currency, incomes, monthly budgets, recurring bills, savings goals, and member split/settle-up entries voluntarily logged by you.\n• Shared Household Data: Member nicknames, roles (Creator, Editor, Registar), shared ledger links, and an activity log of ledger edits visible to authorized members of that ledger.\n• Preferences & Local Settings: Language (EL/EN), theme mode, reminder schedules, and local merchant-to-category memory." to "• Compte & authentification : nom, e-mail, identifiant unique (UID) et photo via Google Sign-In ou e-mail/mot de passe (Firebase Authentication).\n• Profil privé (propriétaire uniquement) : téléphone, date de naissance, profession et ville sont isolés dans un sous-document strictement privé, invisible aux autres utilisateurs.\n• Données budgétaires : montants, descriptions, catégories, dates, devise, revenus, budgets, factures récurrentes, objectifs et partages saisis par vos soins.\n• Carnets partagés : prénoms/surnoms, rôles (Créateur, Éditeur, Saisie), liens de partage et journal d'activité visible aux membres autorisés.\n• Préférences locales : langue, thème, horaires de rappels et mémoire locale des commerçants.",
        "3. Bank & Wallet Push Notification Reader (Optional, 100% On-Device)" to "3. Lecteur de notifications bancaires (Optionnel, 100 % local)",
        "• Strictly Opt-In: The Bank Notification Auto-Catcher (Android NotificationListenerService) is completely disabled by default. It activates ONLY after you review our in-app Prominent Disclosure and manually grant Notification Access in Android System Settings.\n• Strict Filtering & On-Device Parsing: Finsay filters solely for recognized banking and digital wallet notification packages (ignoring personal messages, chats, emails, and OTP/2FA codes). Merchant name and transaction amount are parsed 100% locally in device memory.\n• Zero Transmission & Explicit Save: Raw notification text is NEVER uploaded to Finsay servers, logged externally, or shared with third parties. Detected alerts create a local draft only; an expense is saved and synced to the cloud ONLY if you actively tap Save/Confirm.\n• No Bank Credentials / No Open Banking: Finsay never collects banking logins, passwords, card numbers, PINs, or PSD2/Open Banking tokens.\n• Revocation: You may disable this feature anytime in App Settings or Android System Settings." to "• Strictement optionnel : désactivé par défaut, il ne s'active qu'après votre autorisation manuelle dans les paramètres Android.\n• Filtrage strict & analyse locale : seules les notifications bancaires/portefeuilles reconnues sont traitées localement (SMS, chats, e-mails et codes OTP ignorés).\n• Aucune transmission : le texte brut n'est jamais envoyé ni partagé. Seul un brouillon local est créé jusqu'à votre validation.\n• Aucun identifiant bancaire : Finsay ne collecte ni mots de passe bancaires, ni numéros de carte, ni jetons PSD2.\n• Révocation : désactivable à tout moment dans les paramètres.",
        "4. Camera, Receipt OCR, AADE/e-Invoicing QR Lookup & Voice Entry" to "4. Caméra, OCR de reçus, QR AADE et saisie vocale",
        "• Camera & Photo Picker: Camera access (CAMERA) or the zero-permission Android Photo Picker is used solely when you choose to scan a receipt or QR code. OCR text recognition and barcode decoding run locally on-device via Google ML Kit; receipt images are not uploaded to Finsay servers.\n• Greek AADE / e-Invoicing QR Verification: When you scan a Greek tax/e-invoicing QR code, the app may perform a direct, read-only HTTPS lookup strictly to allowlisted official tax/e-invoicing domains (e.g., aade.gr and certified Greek e-invoicing providers) solely to retrieve merchant name, VAT/AFM, date, and total amount.\n• Voice Expense Entry (RECORD_AUDIO): Used only when you press the microphone button. Speech-to-text relies on Android's native SpeechRecognizer service (subject to your device/Google speech service terms), and the resulting text is parsed locally into a draft expense. Finsay does NOT record, save, or upload audio files." to "• Caméra & galerie : utilisés uniquement lorsque vous scannez un reçu ou QR code. L'OCR et la lecture s'exécutent localement via Google ML Kit ; aucune image n'est téléversée.\n• Vérification QR AADE : lors du scan d'un QR fiscal grec, une requête HTTPS en lecture seule vers des domaines officiels autorisés (ex. aade.gr) peut récupérer commerçant, TVA, date et montant.\n• Saisie vocale (RECORD_AUDIO) : active uniquement quand vous appuyez sur le micro via SpeechRecognizer d'Android. Finsay n'enregistre ni n'envoie aucun fichier audio.",
        "5. Biometric App Lock, Local Merchant Memory & Device Features" to "5. Verrouillage biométrique, mémoire locale et appareil",
        "• Optional Biometric & PIN App Lock: Fingerprint/Face Unlock uses Android BiometricPrompt handled exclusively by your device's secure OS hardware. Finsay NEVER accesses, collects, stores, or transmits biometric identifiers or templates (compliant with GDPR Art. 9 and US state biometric laws such as BIPA/CUBI). Any optional 4-digit PIN is stored strictly on-device as a salted SHA-256 hash.\n• Smart Merchant Category Memory: Category corrections for merchants/VAT IDs are stored locally on-device (SharedPreferences) solely to improve auto-suggestions.\n• Reminders, Widgets, Quick Tile & App Shortcuts: Local notifications (POST_NOTIFICATIONS, RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED, WAKE_LOCK, VIBRATE) deliver user-configured reminders and bank-draft prompts. Widgets, Quick Settings tiles, and launcher App Shortcuts operate locally." to "• Biométrie & PIN : gérés exclusivement par Android BiometricPrompt. Finsay n'accède ni ne stocke aucune donnée biométrique. Le PIN optionnel est stocké localement en empreinte SHA-256 salée.\n• Mémoire des commerçants : vos corrections de catégorie sont stockées uniquement sur votre appareil.\n• Rappels, widgets et raccourcis : les notifications locales et vignettes fonctionnent localement sur l'appareil.",
        "6. Legal Bases (GDPR / UK GDPR), Zero Ads & No Data Selling" to "6. Bases légales (RGPD), zéro pub et non-vente des données",
        "• Performance of Contract (Art. 6(1)(b)): Delivering budgeting, multi-currency tracking, analytics, cloud sync, shared ledgers, and data exports.\n• Consent (Art. 6(1)(a)): Mandatory acceptance of these Terms & Privacy Policy (version and timestamp recorded in your private owner-only profile), plus optional bank notification parsing, camera/OCR, microphone voice input, and reminder notifications (withdrawable anytime).\n• Legitimate Interests (Art. 6(1)(f)): Ensuring security, preventing unauthorized access via Firebase Authentication and Zero-Trust Firestore Security Rules, and maintaining service reliability.\n• Zero Ads, No Data Brokers & No Third-Party AI Uploads: Finsay displays no ads, does NOT sell or rent personal data, does NOT share personal data for cross-context behavioral advertising, and does NOT transmit your financial data to third-party cloud LLM/AI services." to "• Exécution du contrat (Art. 6.1.b) : suivi budgétaire, multi-devises, statistiques, synchro Cloud, partage et exports.\n• Consentement (Art. 6.1.a) : acceptation des CGU/Confidentialité et fonctions optionnelles (lecteur bancaire, OCR, voix, rappels), révocable à tout moment.\n• Intérêt légitime (Art. 6.1.f) : sécurité des comptes, règles Zero-Trust Firestore et fiabilité.\n• Zéro publicité : Finsay n'affiche aucune pub, ne vend ni ne loue vos données et ne les transmet à aucune IA tierce.",
        "7. Cloud Infrastructure, Security & International Transfers" to "7. Infrastructure Cloud, sécurité et transferts",
        "• Crash & Performance Diagnostics: Finsay uses Firebase Crashlytics and Firebase Performance Monitoring solely to detect crashes and improve app responsiveness. Only anonymous technical diagnostics (device model, OS version, stack traces, and app startup/sync timings) are collected—never financial entries, amounts, emails, or personal identifiers." to "• Diagnostics de plantage et de performance : Finsay utilise Firebase Crashlytics et Firebase Performance Monitoring uniquement pour détecter les plantages et améliorer la réactivité. Seules des données techniques anonymes (modèle d'appareil, version Android, traces d'erreur et temps de chargement) sont collectées — jamais vos données financières, montants, e-mails ou identifiants personnels.",
        "• Storage & Security: Cloud data is hosted on Google Cloud / Firebase Firestore with TLS encryption in transit, AES encryption at rest, Firebase Authentication, and Zero-Trust Security Rules restricting reads/writes to authorized ledger members.\n• International Data Transfers: Because Google Cloud / Firebase operates global infrastructure (including EU and US servers), any transfers outside the EEA or UK are safeguarded by EU Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs), the UK International Data Transfer Addendum, and Google LLC's certification under the EU-US / UK-US Data Privacy Framework.\n• Google Play Services: Finsay Pro purchases are processed exclusively by Google Play Billing (we never see or store payment card details). Native Google Play In-App Updates and In-App Review APIs may run discreetly under Google's Privacy Policy." to "• Hébergement & sécurité : Google Cloud / Firebase Firestore avec chiffrement TLS en transit, AES au repos et règles Zero-Trust.\n• Transferts internationaux : encadrés par les clauses contractuelles types (CCT) de l'UE et le cadre de protection des données UE-États-Unis.\n• Google Play : les achats Finsay Pro passent exclusivement par Google Play Billing ; nous ne voyons jamais vos coordonnées bancaires.",
        "8. Data Retention, Exports & Permanent Account Deletion" to "8. Conservation, export et suppression du compte",
        "• Retention: We retain your account and ledger data only for as long as your account remains active or until you delete specific entries or your entire account.\n• Data Portability: You may export your expenses, incomes, balances, and member settle-up summaries to Excel (.xls), PDF (.pdf), or CSV (.csv) locally on-device anytime.\n• Immediate Account Deletion: You may permanently delete your account, private profile, owned ledgers, and cloud/local data directly in the app (Menu (☰) > My Profile > Delete Account) or via https://finsayapp.com/delete-account.html. Residual cloud backups are purged within standard infrastructure cycles (up to 30 days)." to "• Conservation : vos données sont conservées tant que votre compte reste actif ou jusqu'à leur suppression.\n• Portabilité : exportez vos dépenses, revenus, soldes et équilibrages en Excel, PDF ou CSV à tout moment.\n• Suppression immédiate : supprimez définitivement votre compte depuis Menu (☰) > Profil > Supprimer le compte ou sur https://finsayapp.com/delete-account.html (purge des sauvegardes résiduelles sous 30 jours max).",
        "9. Your Rights (Greece, EU/EEA, UK & United States)" to "9. Vos droits (UE/EEE, Royaume-Uni et États-Unis)",
        "• Greece, EU/EEA & UK (GDPR / Law 4624/2019 / UK GDPR): You have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict processing, data portability, object, withdraw consent at any time, and lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority—including the Hellenic Data Protection Authority (HDPA, www.dpa.gr) or the UK ICO.\n• United States (California CCPA/CPRA & State Privacy Laws — VA, CO, CT, UT, TX, etc.): US residents have the right to know/access personal information collected, request deletion, request correction of inaccurate data, obtain a portable copy, and receive non-discriminatory treatment when exercising privacy rights. Finsay DOES NOT \"sell\" personal information and DOES NOT \"share\" personal information for cross-context behavioral advertising. Sensitive personal information is used strictly as necessary to provide requested app features.\n• Exercising Rights: Use in-app tools or email support@finsayapp.com; we verify and respond within 30 days (or the statutory period under applicable law)." to "• UE/EEE & Royaume-Uni (RGPD) : droit d'accès, rectification, effacement, limitation, portabilité, opposition, retrait du consentement et réclamation auprès de votre autorité de contrôle (ex. CNIL ou HDPA, www.dpa.gr).\n• États-Unis (CCPA/CPRA et lois d'État) : droit d'accès, suppression, correction et portabilité sans discrimination. Finsay ne vend ni ne partage vos données.\n• Exercer vos droits : via l'app ou à support@finsayapp.com (réponse sous 30 jours).",
        "10. Children's Privacy (COPPA & GDPR Art. 8) & Changes" to "10. Mineurs et modifications de la politique",
        "• Children's Privacy: Finsay is not intended for children under 13 years of age (US COPPA) or under 16 years of age (or the applicable digital consent age in your EU/EEA/UK country under GDPR Art. 8). We do not knowingly collect data from children; contact support@finsayapp.com for immediate deletion if you believe a child provided data.\n• Policy Updates: We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect new features or legal requirements. Material changes will be notified in-app or on finsayapp.com." to "• Mineurs : Finsay n'est pas destinée aux moins de 13 ans (COPPA) ni aux moins de 16 ans dans l'UE/EEE (ou l'âge légal local). Contactez support@finsayapp.com pour suppression immédiate le cas échéant.\n• Mises à jour : les modifications importantes seront notifiées dans l'app ou sur finsayapp.com.",
        "1. Acceptance of Terms & Eligibility (Updated: November 2026)" to "1. Acceptation des conditions et éligibilité (Novembre 2026)",
        "By downloading, installing, registering for, or using Finsay (finsayapp.com), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy. You must be at least 16 years old in the EU/EEA/UK (or the applicable legal digital consent age in your jurisdiction) and at least 13 years old in the United States (or have verifiable parental consent where required) to use Finsay. If you do not agree, do not use the application." to "En téléchargeant ou utilisant Finsay (finsayapp.com), vous acceptez ces Conditions d'utilisation et notre Politique de confidentialité. Vous devez avoir au moins 16 ans dans l'UE/EEE/Royaume-Uni (ou l'âge légal applicable) et 13 ans aux États-Unis. En cas de désaccord, n'utilisez pas l'application.",
        "2. Service Description & Strict Financial / Tax Advice Disclaimer" to "2. Description du service et absence de conseil financier",
        "Finsay is an informational personal and household expense, income, budget, multi-currency, and split-tracking tool. Finsay DOES NOT provide financial, investment, banking, accounting, legal, or tax advice, nor does it execute payments, currency conversions, or money transfers. Displayed currencies are purely organizational labels; Finsay does not perform regulated foreign-exchange brokerage. You remain solely responsible for verifying all figures, tax obligations, and financial decisions." to "Finsay est un outil informatif de suivi budgétaire et de partage de dépenses. Finsay ne fournit aucun conseil financier, fiscal, comptable ou juridique et n'exécute aucun paiement ni change de devises. Vous restez seul responsable de vos chiffres et décisions.",
        "3. Bank Notification Reader Disclaimer (No Open Banking / PSD2)" to "3. Lecteur de notifications bancaires (Hors DSP2 / Open Banking)",
        "• Independent Local Utility: The optional Bank Notification Auto-Catcher reads Android payment notifications solely on-device after your explicit system authorization. Finsay is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to any bank, card issuer, or payment institution, and does NOT operate as a PSD2 / Open Banking Account Information Service Provider (AISP) or Payment Initiation Service Provider (PISP).\n• Best-Effort Accuracy: Because banks frequently change notification wording and Android battery/OEM policies may delay or restrict background delivery, Finsay cannot guarantee that every card payment will be detected or parsed with 100% accuracy. You must review and confirm every draft before saving and rely on official bank statements for authoritative records." to "• Outil local indépendant : lit les notifications uniquement sur votre appareil après autorisation. Finsay n'est affiliée à aucune banque et n'est pas un prestataire DSP2 / Open Banking.\n• Vérification requise : les libellés bancaires et restrictions Android pouvant varier, vérifiez chaque brouillon et fiez-vous à vos relevés officiels.",
        "4. Receipt OCR, AADE / e-Invoicing QR Lookup & Voice Entry" to "4. OCR de reçus, QR AADE et dictée vocale",
        "Optical character recognition (OCR), QR receipt lookups (including direct read-only queries to allowlisted Greek tax/e-invoicing portals such as AADE), and voice-to-text parsing are automated convenience features that may occasionally misread text, speech, dates, or totals. Finsay is not affiliated with AADE or any e-invoicing provider. You are solely responsible for checking and correcting auto-filled values against original receipts before saving." to "L'OCR, les requêtes QR AADE et la dictée vocale sont des aides automatiques pouvant comporter des erreurs de lecture. Finsay n'est affiliée à aucun organisme fiscal. Vérifiez toujours les valeurs avant d'enregistrer.",
        "5. Shared Households, Member Roles & Third-Party Consent" to "5. Carnets partagés, rôles et consentement",
        "When creating or participating in a shared ledger (Creator, Editor, Registar), you acknowledge that financial entries, split balances, and ledger activity logs are visible to all authorized members of that ledger according to their roles. You represent and warrant that you have obtained appropriate consent before entering another individual's personal information or inviting them to a shared ledger, and you are responsible for managing member access in ledgers you control." to "En participant à un carnet partagé (Créateur, Éditeur, Saisie), vous acceptez que les opérations, soldes et historiques soient visibles aux membres autorisés. Vous garantissez disposer du consentement nécessaire pour inviter des tiers.",
        "6. Account Security, Optional App Lock & Data Exports" to "6. Sécurité du compte, verrouillage et exports",
        "• Credentials & Local App Lock: You are responsible for safeguarding your sign-in credentials and device. Optional Biometric/PIN App Lock is a local convenience safeguard; if you forget your PIN or lose device biometric access, recovery may require re-authentication or reinstalling the app.\n• Exported Files: When you export reports (Excel, PDF, CSV) and share them via third-party apps (email, messaging, cloud drives), those exported copies leave Finsay's control and their confidentiality becomes your sole responsibility." to "• Identifiants & verrouillage : protégez vos accès et votre appareil. En cas d'oubli du PIN local, une reconnexion ou réinstallation peut être nécessaire.\n• Fichiers exportés : tout rapport exporté (Excel, PDF, CSV) et partagé via une autre app relève de votre seule responsabilité.",
        "7. Finsay Pro Subscriptions, Renewals & Refunds (Google Play)" to "7. Abonnements Finsay Pro, renouvellements et remboursements",
        "• Billing & Auto-Renewal: Certain advanced features (such as Bank Notification Auto-Catcher, multiple ledgers, and unlimited members) require a Finsay Pro subscription or lifetime purchase processed exclusively via Google Play Billing. Recurring subscriptions automatically renew unless cancelled in Google Play settings before the end of the current billing period.\n• Refunds & Consumer Rights: Pricing, cancellations, and refund requests are governed by Google Play's billing policies and applicable mandatory consumer laws in your jurisdiction (including statutory EU/UK withdrawal rights where applicable and US consumer statutes)." to "• Facturation : certaines fonctions avancées nécessitent Finsay Pro via Google Play Billing. Les abonnements se renouvellent automatiquement sauf annulation préalable dans Google Play.\n• Remboursements : régis par Google Play et les droits impératifs des consommateurs applicables.",
        "8. Acceptable Use & Intellectual Property" to "8. Utilisation acceptable et propriété intellectuelle",
        "You agree not to misuse Finsay, bypass authentication or security rules, attempt unauthorized access to other users' data, reverse-engineer or copy proprietary components except as permitted by mandatory law, or use the app for fraudulent or unlawful purposes. All Finsay trademarks, branding, design, and software remain the intellectual property of Finsay and its creators." to "Vous vous engagez à ne pas détourner Finsay, contourner sa sécurité, accéder sans droit aux données d'autrui ou faire d'ingénierie inverse hors exceptions légales. Marques, designs et logiciels restent la propriété de Finsay.",
        "9. Disclaimer of Warranties & Limitation of Liability" to "9. Exclusion de garanties et limitation de responsabilité",
        "To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Finsay is provided \"AS IS\" and \"AS AVAILABLE\" without warranties of uninterrupted operation or error-free parsing. To the maximum extent permitted by law, Finsay and its developers shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, special, punitive, or consequential damages, missed bill reminders, unparsed notifications, or loss of profits/data; aggregate liability shall not exceed the total amount paid by you for Finsay Pro during the twelve (12) months preceding the claim.\n• Statutory Carve-Out (EU/UK/US): Nothing in these Terms excludes or limits liability that cannot legally be excluded under mandatory law (including gross negligence, willful misconduct, fraud, or mandatory statutory consumer rights in the EU/EEA, UK, or US states)." to "Dans les limites légales, Finsay est fournie « EN L'ÉTAT » sans garantie de fonctionnement ininterrompu. Notre responsabilité totale n'excède pas le montant payé pour Finsay Pro sur les 12 derniers mois, sans jamais limiter vos droits impératifs de consommateur (UE/EEE, Royaume-Uni, États-Unis).",
        "10. Termination, Changes, Governing Law & International Consumer Rights" to "10. Résiliation, modifications et droit applicable",
        "• Termination: You may terminate your account anytime via Menu (☰) > My Profile > Delete Account. We may suspend accounts that materially violate these Terms or threaten platform security.\n• Governing Law & Consumer Carve-Out: These Terms are governed by the laws of the Hellenic Republic (Greece) and applicable European Union law, with disputes submitted to the courts of Athens, Greece. However, if you are a consumer residing in the EU/EEA, the UK, or the United States, nothing in these Terms deprives you of the mandatory consumer protection laws or statutory forum rights of your country or state of residence.\n• Contact: support@finsayapp.com." to "• Résiliation : supprimez votre compte à tout moment via Menu (☰) > Profil > Supprimer le compte.\n• Droit applicable : régi par le droit grec et européen (tribunaux d'Athènes), sans préjudice des dispositions impératives de protection des consommateurs de votre pays de résidence.\n• Contact : support@finsayapp.com."
    )
}
